title: "sports-video-coach: agent-first sports video analysis and coaching"
abstract: "An agent-first framework that turns a person's own game or training video into a coach's film review, a coaching page with narration and clips, and an explained video. A sport-agnostic core with a step driver for coding agents, a generic plugin for any sport and a basketball plugin with computer-vision tracking."
